          "note": "日中なら Have a good day."
        },
        {
          "id": "w_018",
          "en": "Could I get 〜? に入るもの",
          "ja": "an extra towel（バスタオル追加）/ a wake-up call（モーニングコール）/ some ice（氷）/ an extra pillow（枕追加）/ a room with a view（眺めのいい部屋）",
